{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the Demo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo you'll explore a galaxy with 5 planets and a boss in the end. You'll have lots of items and builds to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About Mouldog</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>- TRAVEL BETWEEN PLANETS</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel from sector to sector, explore multiple planets with their own ecosystem and resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to overcome Epic Bosses to reach the next sector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901720/extras/3c4fd21389d8923ab37a22c7322b2706.poster.avif?t=1757612903\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901720/extras/3c4fd21389d8923ab37a22c7322b2706.webm?t=1757612903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901720/extras/3c4fd21389d8923ab37a22c7322b2706.mp4?t=1757612903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>-\u00a0GATHER RESOURCES</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine the planets precious ores.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight ferocious monster inhabiting the planets and gather their loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planets are unstable so you'll have limited time to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901720/extras/d4ad7ba3564dc401b38a52536958c4dc.poster.avif?t=1757612903\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901720/extras/d4ad7ba3564dc401b38a52536958c4dc.webm?t=1757612903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901720/extras/d4ad7ba3564dc401b38a52536958c4dc.mp4?t=1757612903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-</strong><u> <strong>UPGRADE YOUR ARSENAL</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft or Upgrade items,</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exchange your resources in the shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Buy new tools, weapons, perks that will make you stronger and more versatile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901720/extras/415bfb05a6fca35131100721888d6992.poster.avif?t=1757612903\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901720/extras/415bfb05a6fca35131100721888d6992.webm?t=1757612903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901720/extras/415bfb05a6fca35131100721888d6992.mp4?t=1757612903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>- SAVE THE GALAXY</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interdimensional breach has opened in your galaxy. You're mission is to reach and seal it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-<u>\u00a0PLAY WITH YOU FRIENDS</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can be played with up to 4 players online.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3901720?t=1757612903","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901720/10fb